{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440090/extras/41c4c908400f347e39834e82106054a9.webp?t=1760289675\" width=256 height=11 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>physics-based beat'em up</strong>, unleash dynamic and action-packed aerial combos, taking gameplay to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440090/extras/cee34965ea8c014819c72e7c8762bef0.poster.avif?t=1760289675\" width=600 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440090/extras/cee34965ea8c014819c72e7c8762bef0.webm?t=1760289675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the environment to your advantage</strong> by making the stage traversable to destroy it or eliminate certain enemies in creative and strategic ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440090/extras/31aceb2d90e5f12ac4f38681e9338969.poster.avif?t=1760289675\" width=600 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440090/extras/31aceb2d90e5f12ac4f38681e9338969.webm?t=1760289675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish off your enemies with <strong>spectacular</strong> and <strong>stylish moves</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440090/extras/d04f21c2dcfefff1fd61b58740859d27.poster.avif?t=1760289675\" width=600 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440090/extras/d04f21c2dcfefff1fd61b58740859d27.webm?t=1760289675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn your enemies' attacks against them</strong>, phasing through or returning their strikes with skill and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440090/extras/c70002c273aed54fc1ddfcffcbc8c7dd.poster.avif?t=1760289675\" width=600 height=361 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440090/extras/c70002c273aed54fc1ddfcffcbc8c7dd.webm?t=1760289675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440090/extras/20d5f141a1a9d440a52bfd5f0894b9ef.webp?t=1760289675\" width=600 height=11 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3440090?t=1760289675","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760289675","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440090/7967a065539a2650c4576af0408424ea72c916fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760289675","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440090/7967a065539a2650c4576af0408424ea72c916fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760289675","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"F